	(text "RS-232 level stages (griffin.yml interfaces, RS-232 level stage).\nCh A console: DB-25 female wired DCE; terminal TXD (2) and RTS (4) are received, TXDA and ~RTS_A\ndrive pins 3 (RXD) and 5 (CTS); DSR (6) and DCD (8) strapped to the terminal DTR (20).\nCh B modem: DB-25 male wired DTE; TXDB -> 2, 3 -> RXDB, ~RTS_B -> 4, 5 -> ~CTS_B,\nDCD (8) and RI (22) through the 75189 to IP4/IP5 (unused 75189 inputs grounded); DTR (20) strapped to DSR (6).\nLocal net names follow the DB-25 pin signal (DTE-referenced).  Pin 7 signal ground.\nThe TTL headers share these nets (io sheet, 1k series); 10k pull-ups hold RXD, ~CTS, DCD_B and RI_B\nidle when the level stages are unstuffed.  No isolation jumpers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
